    "detailed_description": "Roommate is a complete Visual Novel that puts you in the place of its characters. <br>You will have multiple alternative routes and several roommates as pleasant as each other.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787070/extras/a071b9c83194da18663d20b1e7771e10.avif?t=1661180748\" /></div><br><br><strong>This game contains two chapters.</strong><br><br>In the first one,<br>You will play as Alvin who is in love with Naomi - his lovely roommate - but unfortunately in a relationship with a moron.<br>You will help her break up or stay with him, but it will have consequences.<br>For a duration of about an hour, this chapter is short but very cute.<br><br>In the second one, you can choose your point of view between the roommates:<br>- Issa, a kind and eccentric man<br>- Amy, a shy young geek who loves video games<br>- and Valerie, the lovely new roommate who will disrupt their routine<br>For a duration of about 2-3 hours, this chapter is rather complete.",
